t":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5071652809","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121613#issuecomment-5071652809","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121613","id":5071652809,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLktHyQ","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T15:41:19Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T15:41:19Z","body":"Yea I can see how that makes it sound like a good entrypoint.\r\n\r\nI haven't had a deep look, but practically `MethodInfo` and similar are critical and sensitive code, so I don't think it's a good entry level issue.\r\nPerhaps the one marking it as trivial had another approach in mind that would have been simpler. I'll ask.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5071652809/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5071764477","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121613#issuecomment-5071764477","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121613","id":5071764477,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLkz7_Q","user":{"login":"TiesDO","id":118288338,"node_id":"U_kgDOBwzv0g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118288338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO","html_url":"https://github.com/TiesDO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiesDO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T15:53:15Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T15:54:58Z","body":"Thank you for looking into it, i understand you guys being extra careful about what you slend your time on.\n\nThis is my first open source contribution and it was a little disheartening to have it closed while I thought I did everything right when picking an issue, so I appreciate you taking the time to ask around a little 🙏 ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5071764477/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5071809775","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121613#issuecomment-5071809775","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121613","id":5071809775,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLk2s7w","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T15:59:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T16:14:21Z","body":"Right, it looks like two problems coalesced here in terms of comms:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117927 was reported as a bug, even though the proposed solution is technically an enhancement (a \"bug fix\" version would have been to show no type at all instead of `: Array`).\r\n- The issue was triaged as low complexity because we assumed it would be easier to implement than it turned out to be.\r\n\r\nTaken together, it's not exactly fair to you that we close it.\r\nBut at the same time, being low level like this, it's not an issue we can trust newcomers to get right, so our rule unfortunately stands. A 200 LOC change to various systems of the engine at once should have rung some alarm bells already that it's not turning out to be a newcomer PR. AI guiding you in the process probably contributed to leading you astray; without it you would probably have run into difficult to resolve bugs.\r\n\r\nPractically I'd like to ask you to seek out simpler issues for the moment. We can revisit this if you shed your newcomer status. (and feel free to visit rocket chat if you have any further questions or would like to discuss the solution)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5071809775/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5071887960","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121613#issuecomment-5071887960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121613","id":5071887960,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLk7eWA","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T16:10:01Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T16:10:01Z","body":"I originally triaged that issue as \"Trivial\" and \"Autocompletion\" under the assumption that the necessary infrastructure for having named var args was in place. So my thinking was, that we only needed to rename some annotation parameters and maybe update the code that displays that information.\r\n\r\nThe complexity and area should have been updated after it became clear in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117966 that we can't actually name them in the core reflection API. The aforementioned PR had serious issues from undisclosed AI use, to wrong claims in the PR description. I did not pick up on the actually relevant part, that's on me.\r\n\r\nI've updated the triage for the issue accordingly now, and tend to agree that it's not a good entry level issue. I'm sorry for the inconvenience and your time!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5071887960/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]